</form> </section><section id="text-2" class="widget widget_text"><div class="widgettitle">Note:</div>			<div class="textwidget"><p>Under Florida law, email addresses are public records. If you do not want your email address released in response to a public records request, do not send electronic mail to this entity. Instead, contact this office by phone or in writing.</p>
</div>
